  "content": "<h1><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdathost.net%252fr%252fbareneil%252fminecraft-server-hosting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1475587/description_7bacedcb-1d61-4bd0-8d04-cb8a0b267406.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"81\"></a></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/apotheosis-addon-compat-datapack-version\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apotheosis 模组兼容插件（数据包版本）</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Apotheosis/Zenith 模组兼容插件是一个轻量级插件，通过直接支持各种以生物为核心的模组来扩展 Apotheosis 的功能。这确保了在您世界中结合这些模组时能够实现集成、进度延续以及更具沉浸感的体验。</strong></p>\n<h3><strong>兼容以下模组：</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farlanders\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>The Farlanders</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-variants\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mob Variants</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rotten-creatures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Rotten Creatures</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a603daf8-e8f1-4e73-bd05-9efe58ec8960.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_dfac5920-0306-4325-9900-aef3beda631c.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b64f8fc7-777d-4b4a-afa6-ec7c52f79ae5.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_34901759-264c-4fa6-a156-b02e92dc7a60.png\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>借助此插件，<em>Apotheosis</em> 能自然融入这些模组所创造的多样世界中，使每一次冒险更加连贯且引人入胜。</strong></p>",
